<title>UK: Brent crude cargo sells at November +10 cents.</title>
<headline>Brent crude cargo sells at November +10 cents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent crude due to load in the October 21-23 range traded between refiners on Monday at November Brent +10 cents for a maximum sized cargo, traders said.</p>
